{"synopsis":"Setelah bereinkarnasi ke dunia fantasi, ia menjadi guru dari Sang Kaisar Wanita sebelum ia beralih ke kegelapan.\n\nMurid kecil yang dulunya sering diperlakukan dengan kejam tiba-tiba menyadari bahwa gurunya kini menjadi lebih lembut, lebih kuat, dan semakin berhati lembut meski ucapannya masih tajam…\n\nSu Changge: “Sialan, sistem, aku tidak mau jadi penjahat brengsek!”\nSistem: “Terlahir sebagai penjahat, takdirnya adalah menjadi antagonis!”\nFeng Wanqing: “Bagaimana jika aku jatuh cinta pada guruku? Aku ingin menjalani kisah cinta manis yang bisa menghancurkan langit dan bumi bersamanya.”","alternative_title":"My Empress Disciple Is About to Turn Dark","author":"九川动漫","artist":"","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"fbeae560-2e3f-470d-815b-dd9d370ab0b9","number":"72","chapter":"72","title":"Chapter 72","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"bdecdb5e-4ad7-4ffe-b27e-c2d121aec8c1","number":"71","chapter":"71","title":"Chapter 71","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"1091d3e8-15bc-4b47-8e75-3e9155a40997","number":"70","chapter":"70","title":"Chapter 70","date":"2026-05-20","released":"2026-05-20","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"96035d2a-05f4-4c61-91d0-03708163970a","number":"69","chapter":"69","title":"Chapter 69","date":"2026-05-01","released":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"2557071e-fc7c-43e9-bf74-dc08aa283760","number":"68","chapter":"68","title":"Chapter 68","date":"2026-04-30","released":"2026-04-30","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"1d851916-c42a-4f75-b4af-0b4e40fa3b2e","number":"67","chapter":"67","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2026-04-13","released":"2026-04-13","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"6203093d-2c3a-443f-bf80-d191872806ad","number":"66","chapter":"66","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2026-03-27","released":"2026-03-27","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"11ec8e14-1c26-479b-9d3b-490e8820181c","number":"65","chapter":"65","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-03-13","released":"2026-03-13","images":[]},{"c